                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.42/232a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Perkins</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-08-21T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 21,
                                1928—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>279. Associated Press telegram from Peking August 20 states American Minister
                    declined to serve on Board of Directors, Tsing Hua College. Please explain
                    circumstances.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Castle</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
